Package: termux-xwayland-bridge
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Termux-XWayland contributors
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: bash, coreutils
Description: Termux-side session companion for Termux-XWayland
 A small Termux package that checks whether the Termux-XWayland Android
 display host is installed and provides safe status/start/stop commands.
 This package does not yet provide compositor streaming.
